---
import ContentLayout from '@/layouts/ContentLayout.astro';
import { Card, CardContent } from '@/components/ui/card';
---

<ContentLayout
  title="下载 TangoForge"
  description="从 GitHub Releases 获取 TangoForge v0.7.0 安装包，支持 macOS Apple Silicon 与 Windows x64。"
  eyebrow="Download"
>
  <Card>
    <CardContent className="grid gap-6 p-6 md:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] md:items-center">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-normal">最新版本：v0.7.0</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-muted-foreground">
          安装包由 GitHub Actions 自动构建并发布。macOS 未签名阶段首次打开需要手动允许，Windows 可能出现 SmartScreen 未知发布者提示。
        </p>
      </div>
      <a
        href="https://github.com/PeiJingbobo/TangoForge/releases/tag/v0.7.0"
        class="inline-flex h-10 items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-full bg-primary px-5 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-card transition-colors hover:bg-primary/90 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noreferrer"
      >
        打开 Release
      </a>
    </CardContent>
  </Card>

  <div class="mt-6 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2">
    <Card>
      <CardContent className="p-6">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-normal">macOS Apple Silicon</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-muted-foreground">下载 dmg，双击后将 TangoForge 拖入 Applications。首次运行如提示无法验证开发者，可在终端移除隔离标记。</p>
      </CardContent>
    </Card>
    <Card>
      <CardContent className="p-6">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-normal">Windows x64</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-muted-foreground">下载 setup.exe 安装包，或使用便携版 exe。若出现未知发布者提示，选择更多信息后继续运行。</p>
      </CardContent>
    </Card>
  </div>
</ContentLayout>
